    archives in pmtiles/, are derived from Kadaster / Topotijdreis and are
    licensed CC BY 4.0. Attribution: "© Kadaster, CC-BY 4.0".
  * Base maps: PDOK BRT Achtergrondkaart © Kadaster, CC BY 4.0.
  * Aerial imagery: Beeldmateriaal Nederland, open data.
  * Art postcards and architecture landmark photographs come from Wikimedia
    Commons and are restricted to Public Domain / CC0 / CC-BY / CC-BY-SA;
    each image carries its own credit, licence and source link in the app.
